  "title": "Für, um, durch, ohne, gegen",
  "subtitle": "Accusative prepositions, FUDOG",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "für, um, durch, ohne and gegen always take the accusative. The mnemonic is FUDOG.",
        "Only a masculine noun changes: für den Patienten, durch den Flur, ohne den Impfpass.",
        "Feminine and neuter keep die and das: gegen die Schmerzen, für das Bein, um das Bett.",
        "ohne often has no article with a mass noun: ohne Wasser. um here means around, not the clock."
      ],
      "vocab": [
        {
